  "id": "event-tinkering-stations",
  "title": "Tinkering Stations",
  "summary": "Interactive spaces where your children can explore, create, experiment and have hands-on learning experiences. Join the challenge and participate in many practical experiments, which allow you to assemble, test and transform your ideas and creativity into a tangible product. Use different materials to create whatever you want, whether it is a car, a house, a rocket or anything else. Join us to start designing and bring your ideas to life!",
